+    `dance stopped after 30 s` and `dance over; dance volume back to 0.50`.
+- From an older server: as before, and the log line ends `player volume 0.50 (no 'seconds': an older server), to the
+  end`.
+
+**`dance_stop`** stops the dance and cancels a pending `seconds` stop.
 
